<title>USA: FREE-TO-TRADE - City of Tacoma, Wash..</title>
<headline>FREE-TO-TRADE - City of Tacoma, Wash..</headline>
<text>
<p>CITY OF TACOMA, WASHINGTON</p>
<p>RE: $101,210,000</p>
<p>ELECTRIC SYSTEM REVENUE REFUNDING BONDS, 1997</p>
<p>Effective at 1:45 P.M. E.S.T., Wednesday, February 12, 1997 all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
